  "prefLabel": "Per 102.30 Dependent care",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Per 102.30 “Dependent care” means sick leave used to care for the employee’s family member when that individual is ill or injured and who is dependent on others for part or all of the activities of daily living.\n\nSource. #5373, eff 4-27-92; ss by #6729, eff 4-21-98; ss by #10801, eff 5-17-15; renumbered by #14132-A; ss by #14434 (formerly Per 102.24), eff 12-1-25",
